 "text": "Treasurer | Kiowa County, KS\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nResidents\nServices\nCommunity\nSearch\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments\nTreasurer\nTreasurer\nThe County Treasurer's office collects taxes on all real estate and personal property in the county. The office is responsible for county motor vehicle registration and issues regular renewals of Kansas Drivers' Licenses.\nContact Us\nBrenda Osborne\nTreasurer\nEmail Brenda Osborne\nTreasurer\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n211 E Florida Avenue\nGreensburg , KS 67054\n211 E Florida Avenue Greensburg KS 67054\nDirections\nPhone: 620-723-2681\nOffice Hours\nMonday to Friday\n8 am to 5 pm\nThe Treasurer's Office is located in the Southeast corner of the main floor of the Kiowa County Courthouse.\nDirectory\nCounty Tax Levies\nAgendas\n& Minutes\nFAQs\nReport a\nConcern\nNotify Me®\nEmployment\n-->\nContact Us\nKiowa County Kansas\n211 E Florida Avenue\nGreensburg Kansas, 67054\n620-723-3366\nQuick Links\nEDX/IRB Property Tax Incentive Program\nNeighborhood Revitalization Tax Rebate Program\nCounty Resolutions\nCounty Budgets\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
